	Vladimir Cosma studied music in Bucharest and in September 1962 emigrated to Paris, France with his family. There he continued his musical education at the [l1054248] under [a=Nadia Boulanger]''s guidance as well as at the [l1014340]. He started as the assistant of [a=Michel Legrand]. He has written the music for many well known French movies.

