	Kevorkian started DJing in New York in 1976 while playing the drums in a club where [a=Walter Gibbons] was DJing. He was also responsible for many remixes on [l=Prelude Records] where he worked in A&R. He had many guest appearences at the legendary Paradise Garage and toured with [a=Larry Levan] in Japan shortly before Larry''s death. He also was resident at Body And Soul with [a=Danny Krivit] and [a=Joe Claussell]. He runs [l=Wave Music] and owns [l=Axis Studios].

