	Etta James was discovered as a teenager by [a=Johnny Otis], with her first hit in 1955. She recorded for [l=Modern Records (2)] and [l=Kent Records] for the remainder of the 1950''s. She signed with [l=Chess] in 1960, recording with them until 1976. From 1965 to the mid 1970''s she battled heroin addiction.



