	She was inducted into the Rock And Roll Hall of Fame in 1993. In 2008, the movie "Cadillac Records" told the story of her career through to the late 1970''s, with her role being played by [a=Beyoncé] Knowles, who also recorded some of James'' songs for the soundtrack.



