	André Fernandes was born in Lisbon. He is a musician with an internationally recognized career and has collaborated over the years with artists such as Lee Konitz, Mário Laginha, Chris Cheek, Maria João, Aaron Parks, Alexi Tuomarila, Tomasz Stanko, Bernardo Sassetti, Jim Black, Perico Sambeat, Jeff Ballard, Julian Argüelles, David Binney, Avishai Cohen, João Paulo Esteves da Silva, among many others in the jazz world.');



