	Denis Blackham has been mastering music since joining [l=I.B.C. Studios] in 1969. For 27 years he cut vinyl, signing the dead wax as [a=BilBo (3)]. Please use this Alias for ''BilBo'' cutting credits (mostly found etched in the runout string).



