	Brazilian Producer & Engineer 

	Owner of [l463642] and [l596510] production companies.



	In 30 years of career, Mazzola constructed a reputation in the Brazilian music that transformed the "mark of the double Z"( MaZZola) into a quality stamp.



	Mazzola is considered one of Brazil greatest music producer in these two last decades, responsible for the artistic and technical quality that can be heard in many records of Gal Costa, João Bosco, Milton Nascimento, Ney Matogrosso, Djavan, Gilberto Gil, Chico Buarque, Simone, Raul Seixas, Elis Regina, Caetano Veloso and others great names of Brazilian music.



