	Records cut by him at Pye Studios can be identified by △F, ♢F and ✳F.

	The triangle indicates that the cutting took place in the Scully Stereo suite (until 1967) and then in the Neumann SX68 suite (since 1967). 

	The diamond indicates that the cutting took place in the Westrex Scully stereo suite (until 1974) and from 1974 onwards in the Neumann SX74 suite. 

	The star indicates that the cutting took place in the Westrex Scully suite, operative until ca. 1974.');

