	Frank Nimsgern wrote more than about a dozen film musics (under this 8 times for the “Tatort”) and advertising trailer (under this Carlsberg U.S.A., Peugeot, Schwartau, Karlsberg, Langnese). He was musical director for “Chaka Khan” of 1994 to 1996.

