	The world premiere of the orchestral suite composed by him “Ocean of Love”, the anthem of the luxury liner “MyShip”, was sung and recoreded by opera star Anna Netrebko. Anna Netrebko could be won for the first time for the work of contemporary composers. “Ocean of Love” is part of the album Aqua, which was produced by Frank Nimsgern exclusively for TUI Cruises with the German Film Orchestra Babelsberg.

	PHANTASMA was called Nimsgerns musical, which premiered on 7 November 2009 at the Saarland State Theatre celebrated. The Opernnetz wrote about PHANTASMA ” Musical today must be played like this”. The Newspaper SZ commented “Nimsgerns yet richest, most entertaining and sophisticated composition.”

	Until the end of June 2010, visitors could the Berlin Friedrichstadtpalast of his compositions in the fantastic world of – get abducted “Qi – A Palace Fantasy”. The press and public alike acclaimed show moved to the present day more than 550,000 visitors.

	From 22 May 2011 was Nimsgern “SnoWhite” daily listed on the “My Ship 2″ TUI Cruises fleet of ships with Hannelore Elsner. Likewise, he wrote and produced the title track video for the CARE aid organization with Jessi from No Angels, Sven Martinek, Klaus Wowereit. October 2011, together with Sebastian Welker he brought a new “RockyHorror Show” reloaded version on stage of the State Theatre.

