	He used to master at [l=CBS Studios, London] during the late 1960s, and at [l=Trident Studios] in the early 1970s. During the 1980s he worked as a recording and mixing engineer at [l=Foel Studio], located in Powys, Wales. ');

	His compositions have been recorded by a wide range of artists.

	He was also a member of the Board of Governors of the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences.');



