	After graduation from Newton High School in 1991, Martin attended the University of North Texas on the Rich Matteson Memorial Scholarship. While at UNT, he performed with the world-renowned One O''Clock Lab Band for three years, touring across the United States, Japan and Hong Kong. He can be heard on four compact discs with the One O''Clock Band. An accomplished writer/arranger, Martin''s arrangements have been recorded and performed by the Airmen of Note and the UNT One O''Clock Lab band, in addition to numerous high schools and colleges throughout the country.



