	Cohen holds a Masters Degree from the Manhattan School of Music and a Bachelors Degree from the University of Miami''s Frost School of Music, where he studied with the esteemed pianist and educator [a=Shelly Berg]. In addition to leading the "Emmet Cohen Trio," Cohen has appeared regularly with [a=Ron Carter], [a=Benny Golson], [a=Jimmy Cobb], [a=George Coleman], [a=Jimmy Heath], [a=Tootie Heath], [a=Houston Person], [a=Kurt Elling], [a=Billy Hart], [a=Brian Lynch] and [a=Lea DeLaria], among others. ');

